=== SUMMARY ===
All assertions passed. Exact curves certified for N=9..14 (and re-certified
N=2..8) equal to the round-robin closed form S_max(N,F) = 2 + sum_ab 2*min(F, n*_ab/N).
For every N=2..14 no negative-pattern multiset attains the top line on any cell
inside [0, cap] (they tie only at/above the cap, where S_max = 4); from the bend
cell k/N to the cap only balanced all-positive multisets attain it.
Total wall time: 32.0s
